msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario9:scenario9_EEB2D58B_2A68_4E9C_8379_91E1270DF884
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ab66a665eb8f8f2bd17f766e2baa2fc35132f17a19cd1845ab5ae2049d73b52
#. default-sha256: 5d562d482ee3a0c145fa7deb1879120c9bffcff6f8167144a8946942b84803ee
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_EEB2D58B_2A68_4E9C_8379_91E1270DF884"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why are you acting... ⟪k:1⟫like it’s all your fault?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pourquoi réagis-tu... ⟪k:1⟫comme si tout était de ta faute ?"

#: scenario9:scenario9_DF5DEAFE_AB08_4F9A_BCBA_1DA2539EC800
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61e61795d3fc10be32657c78607ec797cae6e3d2062305a2a75708976cff499e
#. default-sha256: be98ced195a41ff7d77533de194181d8a9242971d1148e3ab918d7b24c041445
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_DF5DEAFE_AB08_4F9A_BCBA_1DA2539EC800"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are you trying to say everyone would be better off without you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tu veux dire que le monde serait bien meilleur sans toi ?"

#: scenario9:scenario9_924BB831_2A65_4066_B6DF_6B5AF8268651
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f3005ab94e09d96be5d8afc7b6e01d7ce91f6c141f716f48457c3f6681603e9
#. default-sha256: dc75deb25245262c1b8367e658c7b0497bc307cfa756beb9e354487b97640f56
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_924BB831_2A65_4066_B6DF_6B5AF8268651"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Like hell you were."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Certainement pas."

#: scenario9:scenario9_B139A233_E70D_4F3B_8565_A51B4A55377C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5dbd3ceba5f49811b70ab4c4923ef0cfbfc4d4bece47c829e1cee9fea4338b3
#. default-sha256: 0f14962839b97f80f198525b6e4fe3bca9ca92f61ef5a539430440f1b8a7f2ba
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_B139A233_E70D_4F3B_8565_A51B4A55377C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was born to be a receptacle for her pain, to ease her suffering."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je suis née pour être un réceptacle à sa souffrance, pour alléger ses peines."

#: scenario9:scenario9_8EC6D6CB_F486_41D7_BCDE_441BCF502863
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1192d56dba3c7e542afc886250e87b156b04cb0551e4e48b66f8c030b9eb1b05
#. default-sha256: a11586d0c11d91401fe896045183c8455bb8c42c0704eb91a50fdc041f0d1ce8
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_8EC6D6CB_F486_41D7_BCDE_441BCF502863"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That was not how she felt deep down, though.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She was not a saint out of the "
"goodness of her heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais ce n’était pas ce qu’elle ressentait, en son for intérieur.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Elle n’était pas "
"une sainte par pure bonté d’âme."

#: scenario9:scenario9_27B4F3AD_B200_46E0_9E39_760FA23116D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06cfa567393a87c1e98afc10ae1d6a550f90bfa3537b9efc27b75090b892217a
#. default-sha256: 7ffce9bdd75150f4d90dc72d8822e0e48bcd67f844b4278548f518907fd8021e
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_27B4F3AD_B200_46E0_9E39_760FA23116D6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So she took all her “saintly” characteristics and gave them to me—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫caring for "
"others, putting herself second, being forgiving—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle a donc pris toutes les caractéristiques qui faisaient d’elle une sainte et me les a "
"données —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ comme le fait d’être attentionnée, de penser d’abord aux autres, de leur "
"pardonner —"

#: scenario9:scenario9_300588D5_5543_4925_9C59_B86D0CDF8E42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
