msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario9:scenario9_AA49492A_FB24_4BEB_8A11_1B6DE71754A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77ba6b8f403ad18ec76ec0175328c3e1aa19b5989812765af86a0826884e1cb5
#. default-sha256: ae0266c65e18ba16cd7462892964585122f60c2bfe5eacf1f393d84f45f72107
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_AA49492A_FB24_4BEB_8A11_1B6DE71754A6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In a world where I was never meant to exist."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dans un monde où je n’aurais jamais dû exister."

#: scenario9:scenario9_82D5CD06_EFF9_4E8C_BF26_7855E821AEAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9708d840e3342069d1c00d0fe209541827d24d0cf575a8af8a65710bb714eff
#. default-sha256: f5c8094f482e5b6eae4925e1c944859407e0d08e80b15b707633d10da43e14c1
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_82D5CD06_EFF9_4E8C_BF26_7855E821AEAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and Morgana wished to curse the three men’s souls."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫et Morgana voulait maudire les trois âmes de ces hommes."

#: scenario9:scenario9_D3FF89B2_C0DD_42E7_9E15_DDDEC5A0FD03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee9a2619e5d62fe1467e6a324eaedce66e4dace3926141953e2b909576eb6094
#. default-sha256: 28618bb530c53a3915c88bf23098f9e70107ac33bbc451b1c42cbee76ba7fffc
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_D3FF89B2_C0DD_42E7_9E15_DDDEC5A0FD03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In order for an incomplete soul like mine to survive, it needs something to bind itself to "
"the world—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫something strong enough to prevent the universe from “correcting” the anomaly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pour permettre à une âme incomplète telle que la mienne de survivre, il fallait quelque "
"chose pour la relier au monde —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ quelque chose d’assez fort pour empêcher l’univers de "
"corriger cette anomalie."

#: scenario9:scenario9_26C22C6F_3835_4C3F_BA35_F932EDDE9DE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78e461bb394d107e296630ce9187977b0b7ee215adad2ea90e3c4cd4d69daade
#. default-sha256: 4907c03423437ffe1b93aaede56df7afa7bcb12e3b0049c2325e94c3c855b2a6
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_26C22C6F_3835_4C3F_BA35_F932EDDE9DE7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And so the wish of that anomaly... ⟪k:1⟫gave birth to yet another anomaly—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et c’est ainsi que le souhait de cette anomalie... ⟪k:1⟫donna naissance à une autre anomalie "
"—"

#: scenario9:scenario9_D21274E5_3971_4179_BCFE_1CCDE07DEAD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9290d07bdf8895a40bbf9a26a185d29b2dc2f758ae2d381fc2d64e4c6f50c6c0
#. default-sha256: 190864a5b8936ec51c7dd90b1f5a5cee047eab7966cd85f43d54118f3d5d13c5
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_D21274E5_3971_4179_BCFE_1CCDE07DEAD6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫a house that sat outside the currents of time.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫One that could descend into the "
"mortal realm at various times and places."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫une maison qui résidait hors de l’écoulement du temps.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Qui pouvait apparaître dans "
"le royaume des mortels à des époques et des lieux différents."

#: scenario9:scenario9_7B0EB139_01EE_4014_9911_2C1CB1F186DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c35b758304775679b118b63725076a9d923781b6dbbce601445753fb74ed67f8
#. default-sha256: 7a3b8b3a1a4fa8a922c942e35f7bde9149873caf2da9222bb4bfcfba454f242a
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_7B0EB139_01EE_4014_9911_2C1CB1F186DD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And why did it have to be that house that bound me to the world?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et pourquoi était-ce cette maison en particulier qui me reliait au monde ?"

#: scenario9:scenario9_A9956F34_AC58_4FD8_AAB2_17ADFA21C0EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f9ea9a11f52aac864c0c4dcde8247b50df9edc6ca55f284bcdb8dd80e7eb1a6
